    {
      "itemname": "Assignment 2 Submission: Questionnaire (20%)",
      "itemmodule": "assign",
      "iteminstance": 124855,
      "graderaw": 15,
      "gradeformatted": "15.00",
      "feedback": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif;\">By and large, a well composed questionnaire demonstrating a good understanding of questionnaire design. Most of the required components are included and relevant, with clear and well-structured questions. Good application of relevant concepts and terminology. Presentation, language and formatting are professional. Overall, a well-designed and usable research instrument demonstrating good research skills.  <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif;\">However, the areas of improvement are :<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Absence of the 2 main profile variables (i.e., gender and nationality group)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Abrupt introduction of Q 7</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Sequencing of questions</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Lack of aesthetic appeal of the questionnaire</span></li>\r\n</ul>"
    },
